What this application still does not do

To be clear, this scaffold does not magically solve:

anti-bot bypass
private MLS access without permission
CAPTCHA solving
login-protected pages
selector maintenance for 60 live sites
legal review for each source’s terms

It solves the application design problem and gives you the right foundation to build a compliant nationwide aggregator.

Best business/technical recommendation

If your end goal is a real national listing intelligence platform, the strongest approach is:

Use licensed MLS/IDX/RESO data where possible**
Supplement with brokerage/public portal scraping where permitted**
Normalize and merge all records into one canonical listing**
Treat scraping as one input channel, not the only channel**

That gives you far better coverage than trying to brute-force 60 unrelated websites.

